      "description": "Quiet bordered control; toggles invert when pressed (day tabs).",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-row\"><button class=\"ds-btn\">Clear filter</button><button class=\"ds-btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Oggi</button><button class=\"ds-btn\">gio 5 nov</button></div>",
      "css": ":host{--n0:#0e1014;--n1:#15181d;--n2:#1c2026;--n3:#262b33;--n4:#3a414c;--n5:#7d8592;--n6:#a9b0ba;--n7:#eef0f3;--g-news:#2f5bb7;--g-drama:#6a45b8;--g-movies:#b23a3a;--g-sports:#22784d;--radius:4px;font-family:Archivo,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:var(--n7);} .ds-row{display:flex;gap:.5rem;padding:1rem;background:var(--n1)} .ds-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:2.25rem;padding:0 .875rem;border:1px solid var(--n4);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--n2);color:var(--n7);font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s} .ds-btn:hover{background:var(--n3)} .ds-btn:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #fff;outline-offset:2px} .ds-btn[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:var(--n7);border-color:var(--n7);color:var(--n0)}"
    },
